EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Good morning{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}I knew it was cold when I woke up,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
but I didn't know it was snowing!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Hello,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I can't tell by your expression if you
like this snow or not, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

