EN:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Oh, hi!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Nice night we're having{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
