freeze where you stand!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}{{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0007:0006:}}Oh, salut!{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} Che bella notte{{TAG:0007:0007:}}!{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Oggi fa un freddo polare,{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}} cerca
